OL,3,GNEWSASalmon leap back after stream
OL,4,Abends restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn endangered breed of salmon is making
OL,7,Fa recovery after a stream in the Lake
OL,8,FDistrict was rewiggled.
OL,10,FSwindale Beck was straightened in the
OL,11,F1800s to increase land for farming, but
OL,12,Fthe quicker-moving water scoured away
OL,13,Fthe gravel banks needed by Atlantic
OL,14,Fsalmon to lay their eggs.
OL,16,FA decade after the restoration project
OL,17,Fbetween the RSPB and United Utilities,
OL,18,Fan Environment Agency survey found fry
OL,19,F- newly hatched salmon - at three
OL,20,Flocations showed numbers had more than
OL,21,Fdoubled in the past two years.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
