OL,3,GNEWSASalmon leap back after stream
OL,4,Abends restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesman described the results as
OL,7,F"encouraging" and showed the habitat
OL,8,Fwas now providing environment to boost
OL,9,Fnumbers of one of the UK's most
OL,10,Fthreatened fish species.
